Source: safelibs-glibc
Section: libs
Priority: required
Maintainer: SafeLibs Port Authors <ports@example.invalid>
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Build-Depends: bash, binutils, coreutils, debhelper-compat (= 13), dpkg-dev, file
XSafelibs-Shipped-Packages: libc6, libc6-dev, libc6-dbg, libc-bin, libc-dev-bin, locales, nscd
XSafelibs-Deferred-Packages: libc-devtools, libc-l10n, locales-all, glibc-doc, glibc-source, libc6-udeb
XSafelibs-Deferred-Surfaces: docs, source packages, udebs
Description: Safe libc6 packaging scaffold for the required Ubuntu 24.04 amd64 set
 This committed packaging surface only ships the seven required runtime packages:
 libc6, libc6-dev, libc6-dbg, libc-bin, libc-dev-bin, locales, and nscd.
 Deferred for later phases: libc-devtools, libc-l10n, locales-all, docs,
 source packages, and udebs.

Package: libc-bin
Architecture: amd64
Section: libs
Priority: required
Essential: yes
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: libc6 (= @SAFE_VERSION@)
Description: GNU C Library: Binaries
 This package contains the committed runtime helper surface for the safe
 libc6 port, including ldconfig, ldd, getent, locale, and related tools.

Package: libc-dev-bin
Architecture: amd64
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: libc6 (= @SAFE_VERSION@)
Description: GNU C Library: Development binaries
 This package ships the required development helper binaries that remain in
 scope for the phase-3 safe packaging surface.

Package: locales
Architecture: all
Section: localization
Priority: standard
Depends: libc-bin (= @SAFE_VERSION@), debconf | debconf-2.0
Description: GNU C Library: National Language (locale) data [support]
 This package ships the locale data, locale-generation helpers, and debconf
 configuration surface required by the committed safe packaging harness.

Package: nscd
Architecture: amd64
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: libc6 (= @SAFE_VERSION@), libc-bin (= @SAFE_VERSION@)
Pre-Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.54~)
Description: GNU C Library: Name Service Cache Daemon
 This package contains the safe phase-07 nscd frontend together with the
 committed init, service, and tmpfiles metadata required by the harness.

Package: libc6
Architecture: amd64
Section: libs
Priority: required
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libc-bin (= @SAFE_VERSION@)
Suggests: debconf | debconf-2.0, locales
Description: GNU C Library: Shared libraries
 This package contains the committed libc shared-library payload and the
 compatibility mirrors used by the phase-3 packaging harness.

Package: libc6-dev
Architecture: amd64
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libc6 (= @SAFE_VERSION@), libc-dev-bin (= @SAFE_VERSION@), linux-libc-dev
Provides: libc-dev
Suggests: manpages-dev
Description: GNU C Library: Development libraries and header files
 This package ships the headers, startup objects, development symlinks, and
 compatibility mirrors needed to compile against the safe amd64 libc surface.

Package: libc6-dbg
Architecture: amd64
Section: debug
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libc6 (= @SAFE_VERSION@)
Provides: libc-dbg, libc6-dbgsym
Description: GNU C Library: detached debugging symbols
 This package contains detached debug artifacts derived only from the
 committed libc6 ELF payload manifest.
